error[E0519]: an interface cannot declare accessors
 --> $DIR/interface-member.nra:4:9
  |
3 |     let size = func -> int;
  |         ---- 'size' is an interface member
4 |         | get: 0;
  |         ^^^^^^^^^ accessor clause in an interface
  |
  = note: interfaces cannot require accessors in this release
  = help: declare the accessors on the field of a class that implements the interface, or require a method instead

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0519`.
